{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504570/extras/f5f0dc4f7747f1bdff390394976ed2e9.avif?t=1756933105\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504570/extras_big/f5f0dc4f7747f1bdff390394976ed2e9.avif?t=1756933105 width=800 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>It can recognize your fear... can you?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear Effect, the pioneering cel-shaded cinematic action game, returns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Days before her eighteenth birthday, the quiet, enigmatic Wee Ming Lam, disappears under mysterious circumstances. Hana, Glas, and Deke, three self-motivated and ruthless mercenaries conspire to track her down and ransom her off to her father, Mr. Lam, the most powerful Triad leader in Hong Kong, for a large sum of cold, hard cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple extortion mission to retrieve the young runaway becomes a lesson in survival against the most unimaginable of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this intense thriller featuring revolutionary Motion FX technology where you direct your cast of 3D characters within dynamic, full-motion-video worlds. Who lives? Who dies? Only you decide, if you can control your fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear Effect on PC <strong>features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full classic game available on PC for the first time ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot your way through\u00a0<strong>7 - 9 hours of gameplay</strong> featuring numerous adversaries and boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative cel-shaded graphics.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full voice-acting</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack by Matt Furniss and Jason Agolia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-motion video environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revolutionary <strong>Motion FX technology</strong> that puts you inside the action.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fear Factor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504570/576dc0e779a9de6414a4650275d65504b2997285.jpg"},{"name":"Locked and Loaded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504570/1b5ed13061cd4a8c791ac029776440821221f083.jpg"},{"name":"Steamed Ham","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504570/a8247c9da98bec83a02052fc3fffb38b5c161d22.jpg"},{"name":"John Woo-Hoo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504570/493d8b0cf652a2e9bd08bd67566829720dfb5471.jpg"},{"name":"Triad Boss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504570/aac806088ca3e017b8a4eda576ca79a32355df5e.jpg"},{"name":"Rotoship","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504570/aac806088ca3e017b8a4eda576ca79a32355df5e.jpg"},{"name":"Helicopter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504570/aac806088ca3e017b8a4eda576ca79a32355df5e.jpg"},{"name":"Machine Gunner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504570/aac806088ca3e017b8a4eda576ca79a32355df5e.jpg"},{"name":"Back on the Tracks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504570/67007dbe4c92efa80227ed4e595ec4e0721592b9.jpg"},{"name":"Triad Thug","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504570/aac806088ca3e017b8a4eda576ca79a32355df5e.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3504570?t=1756933105","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756933105","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504570/b1bb659aafdec000979009edb3024002d7879dc0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756933105","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504570/b1bb659aafdec000979009edb3024002d7879dc0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756933105","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Fear Effect features stylized yet intense animated violence, including frequent shootouts, melee combat, and graphic depictions of blood, injury, and death. Players will encounter supernatural enemies such as zombies. Despite its anime-style visuals, the game includes some horror-inspired scenes, sudden deaths, deadly traps, corpses that create a dark tone. Suggestive themes and partial nudity are also present, with character in revealing outfits throughout the game.\r\n"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504570/extras/f5f0dc4f7747f1bdff390394976ed2e9.avif?t=1756933105\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504570/extras_big/f5f0dc4f7747f1bdff390394976ed2e9.avif?t=1756933105 width=800 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>It can recognize your fear... can you?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear Effect, the pioneering cel-shaded cinematic action game, returns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Days before her eighteenth birthday, the quiet, enigmatic Wee Ming Lam, disappears under mysterious circumstances. Hana, Glas, and Deke, three self-motivated and ruthless mercenaries conspire to track her down and ransom her off to her father, Mr. Lam, the most powerful Triad leader in Hong Kong, for a large sum of cold, hard cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple extortion mission to retrieve the young runaway becomes a lesson in survival against the most unimaginable of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this intense thriller featuring revolutionary Motion FX technology where you direct your cast of 3D characters within dynamic, full-motion-video worlds. Who lives? Who dies? Only you decide, if you can control your fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear Effect on PC <strong>features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full classic game available on PC for the first time ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot your way through\u00a0<strong>7 - 9 hours of gameplay</strong> featuring numerous adversaries and boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative cel-shaded graphics.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full voice-acting</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack by Matt Furniss and Jason Agolia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-motion video environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revolutionary <strong>Motion FX technology</strong> that puts you inside the action.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Implicit Conversions"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504570/921fc9f6769bf7064b7bf5fcac0ec180368556fd/header.jpg?t=1756933105","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Square Enix, Ltd. All Rights Reserved. Fear Effect is a registered trademark of Square Enix, Ltd. Square Enix and the Square Enix logo are registered trademarks of Square Enix Holdings Co., Ltd. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\